<p dir="auto">FYI, BCD data for this page is broken. <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2715504565" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25311">mdn/browser-compat-data#25311</a> (That's unrelated to my changes here.) There's an in-progress PR <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2735978034" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25392" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25392/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25392">mdn/browser-compat-data#25392</a> to address it.</p>]]></content>
